{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24456","headline":"公垂尚书以白马见寄光洁稳善以诗谢之 · 白居易","name":"公垂尚书以白马见寄光洁稳善以诗谢之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翩翩白马称金羁，领缀银花尾曳丝。\n毛色鲜明人尽爱，性灵驯善主偏知。\n免将妾换慙来处，试使奴牵欲上时。\n不蹶不惊行步稳，最宜山简醉中骑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}